      <section>
        <h2>Article 27 (Entire Agreement)</h2>
        <p>These Terms and the Individual Agreement constitute the entire agreement between the Company and the Customer with respect to their subject matter and take precedence over all prior oral or written agreements, proposals, and representations. However, this does not apply to warranties made by the Company in writing.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Article 28 (Governing Law and Jurisdiction)</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>These Terms and the Individual Agreement are governed by and construed in accordance with <strong>the laws of the Republic of Korea</strong>.</li>
          <li>If a dispute arises between the Company and a User or Customer, the parties will consult in good faith to resolve it amicably.</li>
          <li>If the parties fail to reach an agreement and a lawsuit is filed, <strong>the court having jurisdiction over the location of the Company’s head office will be the court of first instance</strong>. However, this is not an exclusive jurisdiction agreement and does not exclude any other jurisdiction recognized by law.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Article 29 (Severability)</h2>
        <p>Even if any provision of these Terms is held invalid or unenforceable for violating relevant laws, the validity of the remaining provisions is not affected.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-appendix">
        <h2>Addenda</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>These Terms are effective as of <Ph value={formatDate(effectiveDate, 'en')} label="Month D, YYYY" />. The revision history is as follows.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="legal-table-wrap">
          <table class="legal-table legal-table--center">
            <thead><tr><th style="width:200px;">Effective date</th><th>Summary of changes</th><th style="width:180px;">Full text</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              {revisions.terms.map((r) => (
                <tr>
                  <td>{formatDate(r.date, 'en')}</td>
                  <td>{r.summary}</td>
                  <td>{r.href ? <a href={r.href}>View full text</a> : 'Current'}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>For inquiries about these Terms, please use the contact details below or the <a href="/en/contact">Contact</a> page.</p>
        <div class="legal-cards legal-cards--single">
          <div class="legal-card">
            <dl class="legal-facts">
              <dt>Company name</dt><dd><Ph value={company.legalName} label="Company name" /></dd>
              <dt>Representative</dt><dd><Ph value={company.ceo} label="Representative" /></dd>
              <dt>Address</dt><dd><Ph value={company.address} label="Address" /></dd>
              <dt>Email</dt><dd><Ph value={company.email} label="Email" /></dd>
              <dt>Phone</dt><dd><Ph value={company.tel} label="Phone" /></dd>
              <dt>Business registration number</dt><dd><Ph value={company.bizNo} label="000-00-00000" /></dd>
              {company.mailOrderNo && <><dt>Mail-order business registration number</dt><dd>{company.mailOrderNo}</dd></>}
              <dt>Hosting service provider</dt><dd>{company.hosting}</dd>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
